menu "Read Pico board configuration"

config READ_PICO_I2C_PORT
    int "I2C controller"
    default 0
    range 0 1

config READ_PICO_I2C_SCL_GPIO
    int "I2C SCL GPIO"
    default 40
    range 0 48

config READ_PICO_I2C_SDA_GPIO
    int "I2C SDA GPIO"
    default 39
    range 0 48

config READ_PICO_I2C_FREQ_HZ
    int "I2C frequency (Hz)"
    default 400000
    range 10000 400000

config READ_PICO_IOE_INT_GPIO
    int "FCA9555 interrupt GPIO"
    default 41
    range 0 48

config READ_PICO_TP_INT_GPIO
    int "CST836U interrupt GPIO"
    default 43
    range 0 48

config READ_PICO_EPD_SMALL_FEED_QUEUE
    bool "Use a smaller EPD feed queue to save internal RAM"
    default n
    help
        epdiy 每个喂图线程持有一条行队列，本板 16 位总线默认 64 行 × 304B ≈ 19KB，
        NUM_RENDER_THREADS=2 时共占约 38KB **内部** RAM（DMA 区，PSRAM 走不了）。
        开启后走 epdiy 的 EPD_FEED_QUEUE_8 选项；16 位总线下 epdiy 退一档
        到 32 行（不再强制 64），省下约 19KB 内部 RAM，代价是喂图流水线变浅。
        需要与 WiFi/BLE 同存、内部 RAM 吃紧的固件可以打开。
        / epdiy keeps a per-thread feed queue; this board's 16-bit bus forces 64
        lines (~19KB internal DMA RAM) per thread, ~38KB total. Enabling this
        opts into EPD_FEED_QUEUE_8, which for a 16-bit bus steps down to 32
        lines, freeing ~19KB of internal RAM at some rendering cost.

endmenu
